---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import EntryList from '../components/EntryList.astro'; import { entries, worlds } from '../lib/universe';
const all = await entries(); const recent = all.slice(0,4);
---
<Base><section class="hero universe-hero"><p class="label">Raj’s corner of the internet</p><h1>This is not my website.<br /><em>It’s my world.</em></h1><p class="lede">A growing archive of places I’ve been, things I want, songs that stayed, small memories, large questions, and whatever else earns a place here.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/explore/">Come inside <span>↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/random/">or find something unexpected →</a></div><p class="quiet">Start anywhere. Follow the threads.</p></section>
<section class="map-strip"><div><p class="label">A map of the archive</p><h2>There are many doors.<br />None is the right one.</h2></div><div class="constellation">{worlds.map(([slug,title,,accent], i) => <a class={`dot ${accent}`} style={`--x:${[15,63,82,38,71,25][i]}%;--y:${[26,19,56,69,82,90][i]}%`} href={slug === 'archive' ? '/archive/' : slug === 'me' ? '/currently/' : `/world/${slug}/`}><span>{title}</span></a>)}<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 26 L63 19 L82 56 L38 69 L71 82 L25 90 L15 26" /></svg></div></section>
<section class="now-section"><div><p class="label">Currently</p><h2>A living snapshot.</h2><p>These change whenever life does.</p></div><ul><li><span>Listening</span><b>Add the album currently on repeat</b></li><li><span>Planning</span><b>The next road worth taking</b></li><li><span>Thinking about</span><b>One question that will not leave me alone</b></li></ul></section>
<EntryList entries={recent} heading="Recently added to the archive" />
</Base>
